{
  "title": { "zh": "把系数装回图像", "en": "Reassemble an image from coefficients" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "<level-ref to=\"2-4\"></level-ref>把一行图变成一排系数。只看幅度时，亮纹在左还是在右可能分不出来。现在检验这些系数是否真的保存了整行：先复原平面，再试一张条纹不从峰值开始的图。",
        "en": "The analyser turned each row into a set of coefficients. Magnitudes alone may not tell whether a bright stripe is on the left or the right. Test whether the coefficients retain the whole row: recover a flat row first, then a stripe whose first sample is not at a peak. <level-ref to=\"2-4\"></level-ref>"
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "\\[\\begin{gathered}\\theta_{kn}=\\frac{2\\pi kn}{N}\\\\x[n]=\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\\bigl(\\operatorname{Re}C[k]\\cos\\theta_{kn}\\\\-\\operatorname{Im}C[k]\\sin\\theta_{kn}\\bigr)\\end{gathered}\\]\n\n\\(\\theta_{kn}=2\\pi kn/N\\)，求和遍历全部 N 个频率。每个系数给出一对参考波的贡献，把所有贡献叠加就重建每个位置。前向系数已经除以 N，逆向不能再平均；只有系数长度而没有相位，一般不能还原原信号。 <wiki-ref to=\"fourier-synthesis\"></wiki-ref>",
    "en": "\\[\\begin{gathered}\\theta_{kn}=\\frac{2\\pi kn}{N}\\\\x[n]=\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\\bigl(\\operatorname{Re}C[k]\\cos\\theta_{kn}\\\\-\\operatorname{Im}C[k]\\sin\\theta_{kn}\\bigr)\\end{gathered}\\]\n\n\\(\\theta_{kn}=2\\pi kn/N\\); the sum covers all N frequencies. Each coefficient contributes a pair of reference waves, and their sum reconstructs a position. Forward coefficients already include 1/N, so synthesis must not average again. Magnitudes without phase generally cannot recover the original signal. <wiki-ref to=\"fourier-synthesis\"></wiki-ref>"
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "v2_inverse",
      "kind": "circuit",
      "step": {
        "zh": "从系数重建",
        "en": "Reconstruct"
      },
      "brief": {
        "zh": "从给定的两张系数表复原原图。恒定图的亮度与条纹的位置都要正确，输出宽高与输入一致。",
        "en": "Reconstruct the image from the two coefficient tables. Match both the brightness of a flat image and the position of stripes. Preserve the input dimensions."
      },
      "inputs": [
        { "name": "real", "label": { "zh": "频谱实部", "en": "Spectrum real" } },
        { "name": "imag", "label": { "zh": "频谱虚部", "en": "Spectrum imaginary" } }
      ],
      "outputs": [{ "name": "out", "label": { "zh": "重建图", "en": "Reconstruction" } }],
      "tests": [
        {
          "inputs": {
            "real": [[0.45, -0.025000000000000005, -0.2, -0.024999999999999963]],
            "imag": [[0, -0.07500000000000002, -5.204748896376251e-17, 0.07499999999999998]]
          },
          "expect": { "out": [[0.2, 0.8, 0.3, 0.5]] }
        },
        {
          "inputs": {
            "real": [
              [
                0.3,
                0.09999999999999999,
                -9.067390516440166e-18,
                4.236297372535286e-18,
                0,
                -4.880950727606728e-17,
                -1.1990237921351275e-16,
                0.10000000000000013
              ]
            ],
            "imag": [
              [
                0,
                1.2346979308880266e-17,
                -0.05000000000000001,
                3.530621445066399e-17,
                -2.4492935982947065e-17,
                -7.444089631977803e-17,
                0.04999999999999995,
                8.382676994819665e-17
              ]
            ]
          },
          "expect": {
            "out": [
              [
                0.5,
                0.5414213562373095,
                0.3,
                0.05857864376269048,
                0.09999999999999995,
                0.25857864376269046,
                0.3,
                0.3414213562373095
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "inputs": {
            "real": [
              [
                0.6,
                -5.551115123125783e-18,
                -5.551115123125783e-18,
                2.2204460492503132e-17,
                7.216449660063518e-17
              ]
            ],
            "imag": [[0, 0, -3.3306690738754695e-17, -2.2204460492503132e-17, -5.551115123125783e-17]]
          },
          "expect": { "out": [[0.6, 0.6, 0.6, 0.6, 0.6]] }
        }
      ],
      "hidden": [
        {
          "inputs": {
            "real": [
              [0.39999999999999997, -0.1500000000000001, -0.14999999999999988],
              [0.5, 0.14999999999999994, 0.1500000000000001]
            ],
            "imag": [
              [0, 0.08660254037844378, -0.08660254037844402],
              [0, 0.0866025403784438, -0.08660254037844396]
            ]
          },
          "expect": { "out": [[0.1, 0.4, 0.7], [0.8, 0.2, 0.5]] }
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "zero = const[value=0]()",
        "quarter = const[value=0.25]()",
        "r = expandRows(real)",
        "i = expandRows(imag)",
        "c = wave(r.position,r.frequency,zero)",
        "s = wave(r.position,r.frequency,quarter)",
        "rc = arithmetic[op=mul](r.values,c)",
        "is = arithmetic[op=mul](i.values,s)",
        "v = arithmetic[op=add](rc,is)",
        "total = reduceRows[mode=sum](v)",
        "outimage = restore(total,real)",
        "out <- outimage"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "zero = const[value=0]()",
        "quarter = const[value=0.25]()",
        "r = expandRows(real)",
        "i = expandRows(imag)",
        "c = wave(r.position,r.frequency,zero)",
        "s = wave(r.position,r.frequency,quarter)",
        "rc = arithmetic[op=mul](r.values,c)",
        "is = arithmetic[op=mul](i.values,s)",
        "v = arithmetic[op=add](rc,is)",
        "total = reduceRows[mode=mean](v)",
        "outimage = restore(total,real)",
        "out <- outimage"
      ],
      "views": { "grid": ["plot", "numbers", "pixels"] },
      "naiveWhy": {
        "zh": "再次平均会多除一次 N，使重建幅度变小。前向与逆向的归一化必须配套。",
        "en": "Averaging again divides by N twice and reduces reconstruction amplitude. Forward and inverse normalisation must match."
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "先测只有零频系数的图来检查整体亮度，再看只有一对带相位系数的图，比较条纹向哪一边偏。",
          "en": "Use a zero-frequency-only image to check overall brightness. Then compare which way a stripe shifts in a case with phased coefficients."
        }
      ],
      "starter": [
        "r = expandRows(real)",
        "i = expandRows(imag)"
      ],
